  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう、千雪。早いな\r\n今日の予定は午後からじゃなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "これから甘奈ちゃんたちと打ち合わせなんです\r\n感謝祭のことで……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだったのか\r\nどうだ、感謝祭の準備は順調か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はいっ、みんなで頑張ってます\r\n特に甜花ちゃんが張り切っていて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花が？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……アイドルとして頑張れていること\r\nファンの方にお礼したいって",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか……\r\nはは、嬉しいなあ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい……！\r\n何かが、少しずつ……変わっていく予感がします",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それで、今はアイディアを集めているところなんですよ\r\nあの『ハッピーエンド』ってテーマで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "今日も資料として絵本を持ってきたんです\r\n何か使えるモチーフがあるかもと思いまして",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "絵本というと、浦島太郎とか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ……！　どちらかといえば\r\nもう少し、幸せなおとぎ話でしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっと、そうだよな\r\n浦島太郎はハッピーエンドじゃないもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──桃太郎とか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あぁ、それもハッピーエンドですね……！\r\n私ったら、ついお姫様の話ばっかり持ってきちゃいました",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "シンデレラに、いばら姫、親指姫とか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうかそうか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえば今度の撮影、\r\n衣装としてドレスの提案もあったなあ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わぁ、そうなんですね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500400202/5004002020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今朝、資料が届いたんだ\r\nティアラとか小道具の写真も載ってたな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5004002020120,
